; Program 5.46: Numerical integration by the trapezoid rule
;   I = h/2 * sum(y_i + y_(i+1)), i = 0..m-1, h = (b - a)/m
; Source: Дьяконов, «Справочник по расчётам на микрокалькуляторах», 1985, p.107 (book61.pdf page 108)
; Input as for program 5.44 (p.105): m С/П, b С/П, a С/П. Output: I in X.
; Registers 0, A, B, C are used; the subroutine at 41 gets x in X, stores it in Ra
; and must return f(x) in X (the book's "..." between ПА and В/О).
; This instance uses the book's first example (p.106, table 5.4):
; f(x) = x³/(x⁴ + 16) = "ИПА ↑ Fx² × FBx Fx² ИП8 + ÷", 16 in R8, a = 1, b = 5.
; (A jump and its address stay on one line, so the line breaks shift after 39.)
; Step 13 prints as a small bold "+"; the algorithm needs ÷ ((f(a) + f(b))/2).
;
; Book results (table 5.4): m = 16 -> 0,906642285 (sic: a doubled 6; read 0,90642285),
; m = 64 -> 0,9073897. The emulator truncates to 8 digits and gives 0,90642272 and
; 0,90738906; the book's digits match 8-digit rounding (0,90642285, 0,90738956).
; @reg R8=16
; @input 16
; @input 5
; @input 1
; @expect X=0.9064228 tol=1e-6
; @input 64
; @input 5
; @input 1
; @expect X=0.9073897 tol=1e-6
;
00: П0 С/П ПВ ПП 41 ПС ИПВ С/П ПП 41
10: ИПС + 2 ÷ ПС ИПВ ИПА − ИП0 ÷
20: ПВ ИП0 1 − П0 ИПА ИПВ + ПП 41
30: ИПС + ПС FL0 25 ИПС ИПВ × С/П БП 00
41: ПА ИПА ↑ Fx² × FBx Fx² ИП8 + ÷
51: В/О
